{"3979350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Butcherman", "steam_appid": 3979350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Butcherman</i> is a <strong>psychological horror walking simulator</strong> with <strong>escape room</strong> elements.<br><br>It's a <strong>short game</strong>, averaging <strong>30 minutes</strong> to complete. <br> <br>Inspired by a <strong>real case</strong> involving a victim who was held captive for a long period by a serial killer, enduring both physical and psychological abuse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore the disturbing world of a serial killer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an atmosphere steeped in the pain, sorrow, and oppression of being controlled by a psychopathic, sadistic mind.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979350/extras/91a45d8902ddfdace671cbdfd32f12b5.poster.avif?t=1783697682\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979350/extras/91a45d8902ddfdace671cbdfd32f12b5.webm?t=1783697682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979350/extras/91a45d8902ddfdace671cbdfd32f12b5.mp4?t=1783697682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Solve puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate secrets, search for items, and gather resources that may lead you to an exit. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979350/extras/b2f5f69cfab068e54792c6937bbedb11.poster.avif?t=1783697682\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979350/extras/b2f5f69cfab068e54792c6937bbedb11.webm?t=1783697682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979350/extras/b2f5f69cfab068e54792c6937bbedb11.mp4?t=1783697682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Growing unease</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being imprisoned and controlled can drive you to madness, and death becomes an increasingly imminent possibility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979350/extras/f7a49bec77171bfd87dbe32cffb4ebea.poster.avif?t=1783697682\" width=1170 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979350/extras/f7a49bec77171bfd87dbe32cffb4ebea.webm?t=1783697682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979350/extras/f7a49bec77171bfd87dbe32cffb4ebea.mp4?t=1783697682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>What to expect</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average playtime: 30 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Professional voice acting (English)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive graphics and sound design </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-detail environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compelling story</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Butcherman</i> is a <strong>psychological horror walking simulator</strong> with <strong>escape room</strong> elements.<br><br>It's a <strong>short game</strong>, averaging <strong>30 minutes</strong> to complete. <br> <br>Inspired by a <stro